    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "you said \"consensus strongly favors\" though. doesn't that kind of ignore people who say single-family zoning is actually good for stability and property rights? it feels like the \"debate\" is kind of a stretch if the experts have already decided. what are the actual arguments for staying with single-family neighborhoods?",
